      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think I prefer the per-rank setting without inheriting up, actually.  When I tried the beta, the only people doing the really obnoxious stuff like full-world shaders, horribly boosted audio, etc were all Purple/Yellow players.   I have a theory that green-bois are gonna be the ones you want to trust the most.",
