  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-23T17:41:53.892Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For example if a user has decided to allow themselves to see custom shaders for Known Users, that should automatically enable shaders for Trusted Users and zvet Users as well.\n\nConversely, if for example a user has decided to mute sounds from New Users, they should also become disabled for Visitors as well, as it is a lower rank.",
